---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = 'Fees — Results, not fees | Life Story Wealth Planning';
const description = 'No management fee. I am paid only on gains above a high water mark and a quarterly 1.5% hurdle rate. If the strategy does not work in a given quarter, I do not get paid.';
---
<Base title={title} description={description} canonicalPath="/fees">
  <main class="fees-page">
    <section class="fees-hero">
      <p class="fees-eyebrow">
        <span class="fees-eyebrow-dash"></span>
        <span>Chapter · Fees</span>
        <span class="fees-eyebrow-dash"></span>
      </p>
      <h1 class="fees-h1">Results, <em>not fees.</em></h1>
      <p class="fees-lede">The wait-what answer, followed by the exact wording, followed by what it means.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="fees-hook" aria-labelledby="hook-h">
      <p class="fees-hook-q">So — what does this cost?</p>
      <p id="hook-h" class="fees-hook-a">Potentially nothing.</p>
      <p class="fees-hook-body">
        Most advisers charge a management fee. Whether your portfolio goes up, down, or
        sideways, the fee is charged. I do not. If the strategy I run for you does not work
        in a given quarter — if it does not exceed a defined threshold — I am not paid for
        that quarter. When it does exceed the threshold, I am paid a share of the excess.
        <strong>That is the whole model.</strong>
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="fees-verbatim" aria-labelledby="verbatim-h">
      <p id="verbatim-h" class="fees-section-eyebrow">
        <span class="fees-eyebrow-dash"></span>
        <span>In my own words</span>
      </p>
      <p class="fees-section-note">
        The wording below is exactly as I publish it. It is the wording that governs the fee arrangement.
      </p>
      <blockquote class="fees-quote">
        <p>
          We charge no managements fees. We only make money by increasing your wealth.
          Performance success fees of 30% are assessed quarterly only on excess returns
          above a high water mark and a quarterly 1.5% hurdle rate.
        </p>
        <footer class="fees-quote-attr">
          Verbatim from the client agreement.
        </footer>
      </blockquote>
    </section>

    <section class="fees-plain" aria-labelledby="plain-h">
      <h2 id="plain-h" class="fees-h2">What that means, <em>in plain language</em></h2>
      <p class="fees-plain-lede">Two things have to be true before I am paid anything.</p>

      <ol class="fees-conditions">
        <li>
          <span class="fees-cond-num">01</span>
          <div class="fees-cond-body">
            <h3 class="fees-cond-h">Your account has to reach a new high.</h3>
            <p>
              This is the <em>high water mark</em>. If your portfolio drops and later recovers,
              no fee is charged on the recovered ground — the water mark is the previous peak.
              I am not paid twice on the same gains.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="fees-cond-num">02</span>
          <div class="fees-cond-body">
            <h3 class="fees-cond-h">The new high has to clear the hurdle, for that quarter.</h3>
            <p>
              This is the <em>hurdle rate</em>: 1.5% above the previous peak, per quarter.
              Small gains do not trigger a fee.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>

      <p class="fees-plain-close">
        When both conditions are met, the fee is 30% of the gains above the hurdle. Otherwise,
        there is no fee for that quarter.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="fees-why" aria-labelledby="why-h">
      <p class="fees-section-eyebrow">
        <span class="fees-eyebrow-dash"></span>
        <span>Why the model is built this way</span>
      </p>
      <p id="why-h" class="fees-why-body">
        I built it this way so my incentives line up with yours. If you do well, I do well.
        If you do not do well, I do not do well. That is how I want the arrangement to work,
        and it is a large part of why the firm exists.
      </p>
    </section>

    <aside class="fees-note" aria-labelledby="incentives-h">
      <p id="incentives-h" class="fees-note-label">A note on incentives</p>
      <p>
        A performance fee can, in theory, encourage an adviser to take more risk than they
        otherwise would, in the hope of triggering a fee. I am aware of it, and it is part
        of why my approach starts with risk management before anything else. The high water
        mark also helps: once a portfolio has fallen, I do not get paid on the recovery back
        to the previous peak — which removes any incentive to gamble the account back.
      </p>
    </aside>

    <aside class="fees-note fees-note-quiet" aria-labelledby="notshown-h">
      <p id="notshown-h" class="fees-note-label">What this page deliberately does not show</p>
      <p>
        No worked examples, comparison charts, or illustrations of what someone "would have
        paid" under this fee. Doing so would represent past or hypothetical performance, which
        sits under specific rules for advisers. If you want to understand how the structure
        would apply to your situation, we can walk through it in a conversation.
      </p>
    </aside>

    <div class="fees-cta">
      <p class="fees-cta-line">The rest of a good conversation about fees is the conversation itself.</p>
      <a class="cta cta-large" href="/contact">Start a conversation</a>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .fees-page {
    max-width: 1080px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 6rem) clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem) clamp(4rem, 6vw, 8rem);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: [outer-l] 1fr [main] minmax(0, 720px) [outer-r] 1fr;
    row-gap: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 4.5rem);
    color: var(--ink, #1c1712);
  }
  .fees-page > * { grid-column: main; }

  /* Hero */
  .fees-hero { text-align: center; }
  .fees-eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    font-family: 'Source Sans 3', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
  }
  .fees-eyebrow-dash {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 28px;
    height: 1px;
    background: currentColor;
    opacity: 0.55;
  }
  .fees-h1 {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4.5vw, 3.8rem);
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 144, 'SOFT' 60;
  }
  .fees-h1 em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .fees-lede {
    font-family: 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.3vw, 1.15rem);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.72);
    max-width: 48ch;
    margin: 0 auto;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* Hook — "Potentially nothing." as visual anchor */
  .fees-hook {
    text-align: center;
    padding: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem) 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.14);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.14);
  }
  .fees-hook-q {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 1.6vw, 1.4rem);
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.55);
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .fees-hook-a {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5vw, 4.2rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
    color: var(--ink, #1c1712);
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 144, 'SOFT' 50;
  }
  .fees-hook-body {
    font-family: 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.82);
    max-width: 54ch;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .fees-hook-body strong { font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink, #1c1712); }

  /* Verbatim wording — treated as legal citation */
  .fees-verbatim {}
  .fees-section-eyebrow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    font-family: 'Source Sans 3', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .fees-section-note {
    font-family: 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.7);
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }
  .fees-quote {
    margin: 0;
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem) clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, 2.75rem);
    background: var(--paper-2, #f4ecdc);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    font-family: 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    position: relative;
  }
  .fees-quote::before {
    content: '“';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0.3rem;
    left: 0.75rem;
    font-family: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    line-height: 1;
    color: rgba(138, 51, 36, 0.28);
    font-weight: 300;
  }
  .fees-quote p {
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.5vw, 1.2rem);
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--ink, #1c1712);
    margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .fees-quote-attr {
    font-family: 'Source Sans 3', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.55);
    font-style: normal;
  }

  /* Plain language — numbered conditions */
  .fees-h2 {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 2.8vw, 2.4rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 120, 'SOFT' 40;
  }
  .fees-h2 em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
  }
  .fees-plain-lede {
    font-family: 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.78);
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
  }
  .fees-conditions {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.75rem;
  }
  .fees-conditions li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 4rem 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: baseline;
  }
  .fees-cond-num {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 96;
  }
  .fees-cond-h {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.35;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 96;
  }
  .fees-cond-body p {
    font-family: 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.82);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .fees-cond-body em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .fees-plain-close {
    font-family: 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--ink, #1c1712);
    margin: 0;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    background: rgba(138, 51, 36, 0.05);
    border-left: 2px solid rgba(138, 51, 36, 0.4);
  }

  /* Why */
  .fees-why-body {
    font-family: 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--ink, #1c1712);
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 58ch;
  }

  /* Notes — asides with quiet treatment */
  .fees-note {
    padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.14);
    border-left-width: 2px;
    border-left-color: rgba(138, 51, 36, 0.4);
  }
  .fees-note-label {
    font-family: 'Source Sans 3', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }
  .fees-note p:not(.fees-note-label) {
    font-family: 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.78);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .fees-note-quiet {
    border-left-color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.25);
  }
  .fees-note-quiet .fees-note-label { color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.55); }

  /* CTA */
  .fees-cta {
    text-align: center;
    padding-top: 1rem;
  }
  .fees-cta-line {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 1.8vw, 1.4rem);
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.72);
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    max-width: 48ch;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 96;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .fees-conditions li { grid-template-columns: 3rem 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
    .fees-cond-num { font-size: 1.75rem; }
    .fees-quote { padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; }
    .fees-quote::before { display: none; }
  }
</style>
